    "title": "Four new git tools",
    "summary": "Add git_config, git_ls_remote, git_update_ref and git_rm with the LLD's argv, outputs, limits and classes, SAFE_REF equal to isSafeRefName as one Unicode pattern, SAFE_PATH forbidding only NUL, every safety condition in the input schema; list them and mark them built by s7 in the coverage table.",
